      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the dining room, Max brings Victoria a flower and invites her out for the evening, but she says she has a business meeting. Seconds later, a courier arrives carrying a huge bouquet of roses for her. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
