      "t": "Спасибо вам за чудесные цветы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Надо их быстро поставить в воду.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through this awkward moment for Max line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Привет, Вика, я тут подумал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi, Vika, I have been thinking.' Max approaches Victoria with a gentle, hesitant opener.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "В общем, это тебе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Anyway, this is for you.' He hands her a single flower using 'to you'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Как неожиданно, спасибо большое!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How unexpected, thank you very much!' Victoria is pleasantly surprised by his gesture.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Слушай, может, вечером сходим куда-нибудь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen, maybe we could go somewhere tonight?' Max invites her out on a real date.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты знаешь, сегодня вечером не могу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You know, I cannot tonight.' Victoria politely turns down the invitation for that evening.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "У меня важная деловая встреча.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have an important business meeting.' She explains that she already has work plans.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Извините, вы Виктория Гончарова, арт-директор?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, are you Victoria Goncharova, the art director?' A delivery courier interrupts their conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Да, это я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, that is me.' Victoria confirms her identity simply.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Тогда это вам, распишитесь вот здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then this is for you, sign right here.' The courier presents a massive bouquet and asks for her signature.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Какая красота! Макс, подержи, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How beautiful! Max, hold these, please.' Ironically, Victoria hands the rival's giant bouquet to Max while she signs.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Спасибо вам за чудесные цветы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for the wonderful flowers.' She thanks the courier warmly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Надо их быстро поставить в воду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We need to put them in water quickly.' Victoria hurries off to find a vase, leaving Max standing there frustrated. Now let's hear the whole scene once more from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
